Negative control for LookupRenderer.test.ts (AC8 static-options fallback).

Removes the `lookupOptions?.options` fallback from the renderer's `items` computed, so a
service-less lookup bag that carries only embedded `options` renders nothing. The AC8
static assertion — that such a control renders its embedded options client-side (and never
calls useLookup) — goes red.

diff --git a/packages/client-vue/src/components/form/engine/renderers/controls/LookupRenderer.vue b/packages/client-vue/src/components/form/engine/renderers/controls/LookupRenderer.vue
index 44f2e458d..72c3c3a50 100644
